    "result_text": "The implementation is complete and verified. The generated `memberId` `NSW2716E6609E1` decomposes exactly as specified: `NSW` (region) + `27` (2-digit fiscal year) + `16E6609E` (HASH8) + `1` (Luhn check digit over the digits of `NSW2716E6609E`, which I independently confirmed is `1`).\n\n## Summary\n\nI unified `customerCode` and `membershipNumber` into a single `memberId` formatted `<REGION><FY><HASH8><CHK>`. All tests pass (`BUILD SUCCESS`, 1 test run, 0 failures).\n\nChanges made:\n\n**`openapi.yml`** \u2014 Replaced the `customerCode`, `checkDigit`, and `membershipNumber` schema properties with a single `memberId` property; updated `locality`/`timezone` descriptions to reference `memberId`. (DTOs are generated from this spec.)\n\n**`Owner.java`** \u2014 Renamed the `customerCode` field/column (`customer_code` \u2192 `member_id`) with `getMemberId`/`setMemberId`; removed `getCheckDigit()` and `getMembershipNumber()`; `getFiscalYear()` now extracts the FY segment from the `memberId`; `getOwnerSegment()` now derives its region via `Region.regionOfMemberId`.\n\n**`Region.java`** \u2014 Replaced `regionOfCustomerCode` (dash-delimited parse) with `regionOfMemberId`, which matches the known-region prefix (NSW/VIC/QLD), else `UNKNOWN`.\n\n**`ClinicServiceImpl.java`** \u2014 `generateCustomerCode` \u2192 `generateMemberId` builds `REGION + FY + HASH8 + CHK` (adding a `luhnCheckDigit` helper over the digits of `<REGION><FY><HASH8>`); `deduplicateMemberId` applies collision handling to the `memberId`; the plain and structured audit records now log `memberId`; `primaryIdentifier` returns `getMemberId()`.\n\n**`OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 Removed the `checkDigit`/`membershipNumber` after-mappings (`memberId` auto-maps by name); `locality`/`timezone` now use `regionOfMemberId`.\n\n**DB schemas** (h2, hsqldb, mysql, postgres) \u2014 Renamed `customer_code` \u2192 `member_id` and widened to `VARCHAR(32)`/`TEXT` to accommodate the longer identifier (up to `UNKNOWN`-prefixed IDs plus collision suffix).",
