    "final_verdict": "VERDICT: LGTM\n\nThe refactor is coherent, additive, and follows the codebase's existing conventions.\n\n- **Luhn logic placement is right.** The check-digit computation moved from `Owner.getCheckDigit()` to a private `static luhnCheckDigit` in `ClinicServiceImpl`. Since CHK is now a segment produced during memberId assembly (which already lives in the service, as `generateCustomerCode` did), co-locating the helper with `generateMemberId` is cohesive. It's not duplicated \u2014 it's relocated to where the format is now built.\n\n- **Format knowledge stays where the old code kept it.** The `<REGION>...` layout was already split between `ClinicServiceImpl` (assembly) and `Region.regionOf...` (parsing), with paired \"keep the two in sync\" comments. The diff preserves that pattern (`generateMemberId` \u2194 `regionOfMemberId`) rather than inventing a new home, so a maintainer will find it where they'd expect.\n\n- **`getFiscalYear()` staying on `Owner` is natural.** It was already an `Owner` getter deriving FY; it now derives it from the memberId segment instead of `registrationDate`, per the spec's \"fiscal-year value must reference the memberId.\" Using `Region.regionOfMemberId(...).length()` to locate the FY offset correctly reuses the single region-detection source of truth rather than hardcoding a prefix length, which handles the variable-length `UNKNOWN` region cleanly.\n\n- **`primaryIdentifier`/`ownerCreatedEvent` indirection is preserved and correctly collapsed.** The audit event still flows through the single `primaryIdentifier` seam, and the now-obsolete \"when unified into memberId...\" forward-looking comments were updated to reflect that the unification has happened. No leftover dual-field bookkeeping.\n\n- **Field/schema/OpenAPI/mapper renames are consistent and complete** across all four DB dialects, the DTO mapper (`checkDigit`/`membershipNumber` `@AfterMapping` hooks removed, not left dangling), and the model, with no orphaned references to the removed fields.\n\nNothing is becoming a catch-all and no logic landed in the wrong unit.",
